  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dioptra for Rapid and Rigorous Cost-Efficiency Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRA innovation Fund (readiness to) scale project.
Dioptra is an intuitive web-based tool that helps humanitarian staff quickly and rigorously analyse the cost-efficiency of their program activities through the smart use of financial data, and compares results to benchmarks to identify adaptations that could improve the reach and impact of life-saving programs.</narrative>
  </description>
